-Formulates the transient signal for non-confocal NLOS setups where illumination and detection spots are distinct, using ellipsoidal coordinates.
+Formulates the transient signal for non-confocal NLOS setups where illumination and detection spots are distinct, using ellipsoidal coordinates. It differs from the confocal formulation by handling asymmetric optical paths via a double integral over ellipsoidal surface parameters, and is chosen when the NLOS setup lacks a shared illumination-detection axis.
 
